<title>UK: Croatia details 300 mln Euro-kuna two-year bond.</title>
<headline>Croatia details 300 mln Euro-kuna two-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by joint lead managers Merrill Lynch and Zagrebacka Banka Do.</p>
<p> BORROWER   CROATIA</p>
<p> AMT    300 MLN KUNA  COUPON     12.5 PCT  MATURITY    18.DEC.98</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.50     PAY DATE  S-08.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.00	REOFFER    98.50     S-SHORT FIRST COUPON</p>
<p> LISTING    LUX, ZAGREB			  PAY FREQ    SEMI-ANN</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK/CROATIA</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    ENGLISH   TAX PROVS   STANDARD</p>
<p> NOTES	=</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
